<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Industries said upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Industries said upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber raised its rating of ITT Industries Inc to buy from attractive, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 22-7/8 in early trading.</p>
</text>
